# T30a queue-random-order: with `random` on, NEXT, PREV and auto-advance walk a
# seeded permutation of the queue; every entry plays once before a repeat.
# Working directory build/host/tests/songs. The playing= sequence is checked
# against an independent model of xorshift32 Fisher-Yates (see the plan, I71a).
QUEUE_ADD selecta-test.mod
QUEUE_ADD selecta-test.mod
QUEUE_ADD selecta-test.mod
QUEUE_ADD selecta-test.mod
QUEUE_ADD selecta-test.mod
SHUFFLE on 7
PLAY
@render 1
@queue
NEXT
@render 1
@queue
NEXT
@render 1
@queue
NEXT
@render 1
@queue
NEXT
@render 1
@queue
NEXT
@queue
PLAY
@render 1
@queue
NEXT
@render 1
@queue
PREV
@render 1
@queue
NEXT
@render 1
@queue
QUEUE_ADD selecta-test.mod
RESHUFFLE
NEXT
@render 1
@queue
NEXT
@render 1
@queue
NEXT
@render 1
@queue
NEXT
@render 1
@queue
NEXT
@queue
SHUFFLE off
PLAY
@render 1
@queue
NEXT
@render 1
@queue
